Tachikawa Tetsuya in an incoming freshman at a new high school and he&rsquo;s a great archer. He wants to join the archery club to meet the one they call &ldquo;Kami no Ko&rdquo;, better known as Fudou Gonzaburou. Tachikawa is good, but he&rsquo;s heard that Fudou is even better. The archery team at this school is in fact very good.<br><br>
Tachikawa also meets a pretty girl who is already a member of the club (he accidentally walked in on her while she was changing). She&rsquo;s not very good from the look of things, but she is his senpai and he defers to her. She takes an immediate liking to him and kisses him after practice.<br><br>
Let&rsquo;s try just to get past the fact that this girl is actually a boy, named Fudou Gonzaburou&hellip;
